species O=C(C(O)(CO)CO)C(O)CO C6H12O6 0 dynamic 0.016469999999999999
species OC(C(O)(CO)CO)=C(O)CO C6H12O6 0 dynamic 1.3910000000000001e-09
reaction C=O + O -> C(O)O ; k=245437.34576194853 ; source=hydration of HCHO (linear)
reaction C(O)O -> C=O + O ; k=104.26268750099064 ; source=reverse of hydration of HCHO, from the free energies
reaction C=O + OC(=CO)CO -> O=C(C(O)CO)CO ; k=10000000000 ; source=aldol on HCHO, C3+ donor (linear)
