reaction OC(=CO)CO -> O=C(CO)CO ; k=23678707152.39843 ; source=reverse of enolisation of a ketone, from the free energies
reaction OC(=CO)CO + O=C(CO)CO -> O=C(C(O)C(O)(CO)CO)CO ; k=1552.1475202189965 ; source=aldol on a sugar (creates a branch)
