reaction C=O + OC(C(O)CO)=CO -> O=C(C(O)CO)C(O)CO ; k=10000000000 ; source=aldol on HCHO, C3+ donor (linear)
reaction O=C(C(O)CO)C(O)CO -> C=O + OC(C(O)CO)=CO ; k=0.00012870685418372315 ; source=reverse of aldol on HCHO, C3+ donor, from the free energies
